ind":"announcement","title":"Joining Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition!","summary":"A special lottery experiment with the 12 chinese zodiac animals! Experience it now at Steam Next Fest!Hello, everyone! We're NextBuff, an indie game development team!We're excited to announce that our game, ZodiacLottery, is participating in Steam Next Fest: October 2026 Edition! 🎉🐭 ZodiacLotteryZodiacLottery is a roguelike game where you manipulate lottery results using the unique abilities of the 12 zodiac animals and create powerful plugin combinations to achieve massive scores!Move animals, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:07:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689384","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838060-1846651706689243","game_id":"steam-4838060","kind":"update","title":"v0.2.3 Update – Profiles, Start, Balance!","summary":"Hello, everyone!Zodiac Lottery has been updated to v0.2.3This update introduces a new profile system and a redesigned game start screen. We've also reviewed several language translations and made balance adjustments to improve the overall gameplay experience.Check out the details below!🛠️Update NotesProfile SelectionYou can now create and select multiple profiles.Each profile saves its stage progress separately.Start a fresh adventure with a new profile whenever you like!New Game Start ScreenAdd","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:29:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689243","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:48:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4838060-1845383656393557","game_id":"steam-4838060","kind":"update","title":"v0.2.0 Update","summary":"v0.2.0New relics have 